<div class="mf-room mfe" data-mf-tool="outdoor-kitchen-planner">
<section class="mfe-hero" aria-labelledby="mfe-planner-title"><div class="mf-room__shell"><p class="mf-room__eyebrow mf-room__eyebrow--gold">The planner</p><h1 id="mfe-planner-title">Plan your outdoor kitchen</h1><p>Answer four questions. You get a typical build cost for the size you have in mind, and the products we would start with.</p></div></section>
<section class="mf-room__band" aria-label="Your outdoor kitchen"><div class="mf-room__shell">
  <div class="mfe-planner">
    <form class="mfe-panel" id="planForm">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="size">Size of the cooking and dining area</label>
            <select id="size">
              <option value="compact">Terrace, up to 100 sq ft</option>
              <option value="medium" selected>Patio, 100 to 200 sq ft</option>
              <option value="large">Entertaining, 200 to 400 sq ft</option>
              <option value="estate">Estate, about 400 sq ft</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="style">How you like to cook</label>
            <select id="style">
              <option value="gas" selected>Gas, fast and simple</option>
              <option value="fire">Live fire: wood, charcoal and gas</option>
              <option value="smoke">Smoke, controlled from your phone</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="climate">Your evenings</label>
            <select id="climate">
              <option value="warm" selected>Warm most of the year</option>
              <option value="cool">Cool evenings or four seasons</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <fieldset>
            <legend>Also planning</legend>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="extra" value="seating"> Outdoor lounge seating</label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="extra" value="pool"> A pool that cleans itself</label>
          </fieldset>
        </form>
    <div class="mfe-panel mfe-result" id="planResult" aria-live="polite"><p class="mf-room__eyebrow">Typical build cost</p><p>Choose your answers to see a typical build cost and where we would start.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="mfe-note">Build costs: <a href="https://www.homeadvisor.com/cost/outdoor-living/build-an-outdoor-kitchen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HomeAdvisor outdoor kitchen cost guide</a>, by area. They cover framing, counters, cabinets and labour, and vary by region. Product prices were checked on the linked merchant pages on 2 November 2026.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="mf-room__band mfe-alt" id="costs" aria-labelledby="mfe-costs-title"><div class="mf-room__shell">
  <div class="mf-room__head"><div><p class="mf-room__eyebrow mf-room__eyebrow--gold">Build costs</p><h2 id="mfe-costs-title">Typical outdoor kitchen build costs by area</h2></div></div>
  <div class="mfe-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Typical outdoor kitchen build costs by area"><table class="mfe-table"><caption>Typical outdoor kitchen build costs by area</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Area</th><th scope="col">Typical cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Terrace, up to 100 sq ft</td><td>$3,300 to $13,000</td></tr><tr><td>Patio, 100 to 200 sq ft</td><td>$6,600 to $26,000</td></tr><tr><td>Entertaining, 200 to 400 sq ft</td><td>$9,900 to $39,000</td></tr><tr><td>Estate, about 400 sq ft</td><td>$13,200 to $52,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mfe-note">Source: <a href="https://www.homeadvisor.com/cost/outdoor-living/build-an-outdoor-kitchen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HomeAdvisor</a> (average $16,480; $33 to $130 per sq ft). Luxury builds with premium grills and stone run to $40,000 and beyond (<a href="https://lawnlove.com/blog/outdoor-kitchen-cost/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lawn Love, 2026</a>).</p>
  <p><a class="mf-room__buy" href="{{ routes.root_url }}#shop">See all 13 pieces</a></p>
</div></section>
<div class="mf-room__ask"><div class="mf-room__shell"><div><h3>Planning a terrace or outdoor kitchen?</h3><p>Tell us the space and we will reply by email.</p></div><a href="/pages/contact?topic=specialist&amp;store=mfo-outdoor" data-mf-placement="odplan" data-mf-cta="ask">Ask an outdoor specialist</a></div></div>
</div>
